<title>THAILAND: PAE to secure 600 mln baht syndicate loan.</title>
<headline>PAE to secure 600 mln baht syndicate loan.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai construction firm, PAE (Thailand) Plc, said on Friday it would secure syndicated loans worth 600 million baht (US$24 million) to refinance existing short-term borrowings.</p>
<p>Of the new loans, the first tranche equivalent to 350 million baht would be borrowed in yen, the company said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>The remaining loans would be taken in baht.</p>
<p>The new loans would help reduce the company interest expenses and increase its long-term debts, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
